049600*----------  BUILD PO KEY VALUE
049700     IF DE1-PO EQUAL SPACE
049800         GO TO  130-FIND-PO-BY-REQ.
049900
050300     MOVE SPACE                 TO  BUILD-PO-KEY,
050400                                    BUILD-PO-KEY-HIST-DB.
050500     MOVE "P"                   TO  B-PO-PREFIX.
050600     MOVE DE1-PO                TO  B-PO-NO, B-PO-NO-H.
050700     MOVE DE1-RLSE              TO  B-PO-RLSE, B-PO-RLSE-H.
050800     MOVE ZERO                  TO  B-PO-RCV, B-PO-RCV-H.
050900
