051100     MOVE DE1-CORPCODE          TO  SAVE-CORPCODE.
051200
051300*****************************************************
051400*   IF THE COMPANY IS A MULTI DB PLANT AND THE 'f1' *
051500*   KEY IS PRESSED THEN BRING UP THE BASIC INQURIY  *
051600*   SCREEN FOR THE CODE IN ITS HOME DATA BASE.      *
051700*   IF THE 'f2' IS PRESSED THEN BRING UP THE OVERALL*
051800*   INQUIRY SCREEN FOR ALL DATA BASES IN THE AKRON  *
